# .nbi.ff = non-bonded interaction (per-atom-type charge/radius/epsilon/mass/
# transfer-energy parameters -- steric, electrostatic, hydrophobicity, IMP).
# Identical duplicate of the .ff file of the same name, kept only for
# backward compatibility with --ff/--grp: the newer .nbi.ff/.bi.ff pair of
# extensions distinguishes non-bonded (.nbi.ff, this file) from bonded
# (.bi.ff -- stretching/bending/[future dihedral] springs retuned onto a
# --rigidbody topology, see BondedForceFieldReader) parameter files.
#
